{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40063","label":"SECRET GARDEN"},"label":"How to Protect the Garden","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"event_secretgarden_01_s","speakers":{"flora":"Flora","rian":"Rian"},"icons":{"flora":"si_c411_00_s","rian":"si_c905_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_1","text":"Hehe, you seem more lively than usual today, Pansy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"SecretGarden","bgArt":"secretgarden","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_inark","movie":null,"shown":["flora"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_2","text":"I lowered the temperature in the garden a little.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_3","text":"I'll have to keep the temperature like this for you from now on,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_4","text":"since you're so fond of it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_5","text":"Oh, I just remembered. When I was last in the Ark, I met a forsythia who was as beautiful as you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_6","text":"I hope I can introduce you two sometime.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_7","text":"Just a moment, Rose.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_8","text":"I'll come to you once I've taken care of the others.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_9","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_9","text":"*Beep beep beep*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_10","text":"Oh my, I'm sorry, Iris.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_11","text":"I didn't realize the watering robot was running low. I'll have to fill it back up today.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_12","text":"Ahhh, spending time in the garden with you all is always such a joy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_13","text":"Hmm?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_14","text":"Are those footsteps I hear?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_15","text":"You heard them too, Lysimachia? Someone's coming.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_16","text":"... Judging from their footsteps, they're quite angry, whoever they are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_17","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_17","text":"*Zing*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["rian"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_18","text":"Damn her, always ordering me around...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_19","text":"I wonder if the higher-ups even agreed to this. If she's gone rogue and is issuing orders on her own, this could be trouble...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_20","text":"Salvia?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_21","text":"Hmph...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_22","text":"Hello. I'm Rian, President Syuen's secretary.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_23","text":"What brings you to the garden, Salvia?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_24","text":"Why are you calling me that? I just told you my name's Rian.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_25","text":"... Oh.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_26","text":"They weren't kidding about you calling people flower names.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_27","text":"Anyway, the reason I came here","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_28","text":"is to deliver a directive from the President.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_29","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_29","text":"*Tap Tap*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_30","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_30","text":"Rian taps on her tablet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_31","text":"Have a look.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_32","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_32","text":"Rian hands the tablet to Flora, who begins to read the document stored on it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_33","text":"The Botanic Garden Squad is to dismantle the garden within 2 weeks. The reasons for this are listed below.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_34","text":"One: Maintaining the garden is proving too costly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_35","text":"Two: The garden fails to serve a practical purpose inside the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_36","text":"Three: Plants can be commonly seen on the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_37","text":"Therefore...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_38","text":"Hmm? Did you say something, Rose?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_39","text":"Only someone with fertilizer for brains could write such a silly \"report\"?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_tepidappleade","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_40","text":"I agree with you, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_41","text":"Lobelia did write this, and Salvia came all the way here to deliver it, so the polite thing to do would be the read the whole thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_42","text":"You don't understand why this is happening, Lysimachia?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_43","text":"Neither can I,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_44","text":"but there are many things in this world we can't understand, and people are no exception.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_45","text":"Since she and I don't see eye to eye on this... I might as well give up trying to understand?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_46","text":"That's a good suggestion too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_47","text":"... Are you able to talk to flowers?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_48","text":"No, their exact responses are only in my imagination.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_49","text":"But I can sense their feelings and emotions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_50","text":"This girl doesn't seem to be in her right mind...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_51","text":"Sorry, could you speak a little louder? I didn't catch that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_52","text":"I... said that I also don't understand the President's decision.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_53","text":"It doesn't make sense to suddenly get rid of a garden that has been operating perfectly fine until now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_54","text":"Very much so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_55","text":"Botanic Garden is responsible for bringing plants from the surface to the garden for maintenance and preservation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_inark","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_56","text":"A task which we have carried out faithfully.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_57","text":"Leaf and Trina are away searching and studying new plants as we speak.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_58","text":"I don't know when they will return to the garden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_59","text":"Making an executive decision to shut down the garden is entirely unreasonable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_60","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_61","text":"This is pure conjecture on my part,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_62","text":"but I suspect that moron—er...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_63","text":"I mean, the President, came to this decision after seeing the Missilis Annual Report.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_64","text":"An inordinate amount of money is being spent to keep the garden up and running, that much is true.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_65","text":"You ought to know that better than anyone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_66","text":"None of the plant life here purifies the air, and they don't provide any immediate sustenance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_67","text":"I hate to take sides on this,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_68","text":"but as far as the President is concerned, the garden is failing to produce dividends equivalent to the investment it requires.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_69","text":"Hehe... It seems everyone can't see the forest for the trees.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_70","text":"The Ark currently possesses the most cutting-edge technology there is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_71","text":"Everything moves quickly in this industrialized society.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_72","text":"When we reclaim the surface, do you think we'll be able to start using all that technology straight away?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_73","text":"I don't think it will be that easy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_74","text":"It will take a long time for everyone to get used to all of that new technology.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_75","text":"Some people may simply reset and go back to the old ways. If that happens, what will we have to rely on?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_76","text":"Primitive agricultural skills.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_77","text":"The flowers and plants that you see here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_78","text":"I believe that one day, these flowers and plants will have a beneficial impact on the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_79","text":"That's what we are preparing for.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_prologue_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_prologue_80","text":"So, I'm sorry, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"imag